{
 "_doc": "Tool registry. scope: read | draft | act. Act requires a human add (human_added true). Deny list wins. MCP catalogs are untrusted: search them, never connect them; connecting is a human accept, scope read first. alwaysLoad stays empty and MCP tool search stays on.",
